{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 11, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "雞", "id": "雞"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.6164830075767194, "source": "敬", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.3096301881366648, "source": "敬", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "敬", "target": "長"}, {"weight": 1.9233358270167742, "source": "敬", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.3933394562625097, "source": "失", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 2.3933394562625097, "source": "失", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.7796338173824005, "source": "失", "target": "雞"}, {"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5178707189086098, "source": "禮", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "禮", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.9233358270167742, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.9233358270167742, "source": "君子", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.6514021115331325, "source": "君子", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.2651077504132419, "source": "君子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.8247235383486646, "source": "君子", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "君子", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 0.6015799870344548, "sou